@startuml SEQ_06_MENGELOLA_PRAKTIKAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-06: Mengelola Praktikan

actor       "Admin / Asisten"   as User
boundary    "Browser"           as Browser
control     "PraktikanController" as Controller
entity      "Praktikan Model"   as ModelPK
entity      "PraktikanPraktikum Model" as Pivot
entity      "User Model"        as ModelU
database    "praktikan_praktikum" as DB

== Lihat Daftar Praktikan ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka tab "Praktikan" di halaman praktikum
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/praktikan
Controller -> Pivot    : Query praktikan berdasarkan praktikum
Pivot -> DB            : SELECT praktikan_praktikum\nJOIN praktikan, users
DB --> Pivot           : Data praktikan
Pivot --> Controller   : Data praktikan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman daftar praktikan
Browser    --> User    : Tampilkan tabel praktikan per kelas

== Tambah Praktikan (Existing User) ==

User    ->  Browser    : Cari user, klik "Tambah ke Praktikum"
Browser ->  Controller : POST /praktikum/{id}/praktikan/add-existing\n{user_id, kelas_id}
Controller -> ModelU   : Query user
ModelU -> DB           : SELECT users WHERE id = {id}
DB --> ModelU          : Data user
ModelU --> Controller  : Data user
Controller -> ModelPK  : create({user_id, nim, ...}) jika belum ada
ModelPK -> DB          : INSERT INTO praktikan (jika belum ada)
DB --> ModelPK         : Berhasil
Controller -> Pivot    : create({praktikan_id, praktikum_id, kelas_id})
Pivot -> DB            : INSERT INTO praktikan_praktikum
DB --> Pivot           : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Praktikan muncul di daftar

== Import Praktikan dari Excel ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Import", upload file Excel template
Browser ->  Controller : POST /praktikum/{id}/praktikan/import {file: Excel}
Controller -> DB       : INSERT batch\n(users, praktikan, praktikan_praktikum)
DB --> Controller      : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Flash sukses + daftar ter-refresh

== Assign / Pindah Kelas Praktikan ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Assign Kelas" pada praktikan
Browser ->  Controller : PUT /praktikum/{id}/praktikan/{praktikanId}/assign-kelas\n{kelas_id}
Controller -> Pivot    : update({kelas_id})
Pivot -> DB            : UPDATE praktikan_praktikum\nSET kelas_id = ?
DB --> Pivot           : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Praktikan pindah kelas

== Hapus Praktikan dari Praktikum ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Hapus" pada praktikan, konfirmasi
Browser ->  Controller : DELETE /praktikum/praktikan/{id}
Controller -> Pivot    : delete() WHERE praktikan_id = ?
Pivot -> DB            : DELETE FROM praktikan_praktikum WHERE praktikan_id = ?
DB --> Pivot           : Berhasil
Controller --> Browser : Redirect dengan notifikasi sukses
Browser    --> User    : Praktikan hilang dari daftar

@enduml
